{"articleNo":"2086","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2086&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"수시모집 특별전형 및 입학사정관 전형 1단계 예비선발 합격자 발표","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.10.28","hit":"13157","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">수시모집 특별전형 및 입학사정관 전형 1단계 예비선발 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">합격자 발표</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/etx/susi/susi1_hap_step1.htm\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></a><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/etx/susi/susi2_hap_step1.htm\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #800080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▶ 합격자 안내 바로가기</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012학년도 수시모집 특별전형 및 입학사정관 전형 지원자에 대한 1단계&nbsp;<br>예비선발 결과를 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다음과 같이 안내합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;1. <span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">수시 모집 특별전형 및 입학사정관 전형의 1단계 예비선발 합격자는&nbsp;<br><br>아래의 일정에 따라서 면접․구술고사</span>를 응시하셔야 합니다. 면접․구술고사&nbsp;<br><br>불참자는 불합격처리합니다.</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 면접․구술고사 : 2011. 11. 05(토)</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 입실완료시간</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 오전반 : 08:30</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 오후반 : 13:00</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 면접번호 및 면접대기실 확인 : 2011. 10. 31(월) 09:00이후 우리대학&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 홈페이지</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 면접․구술고사 대상자 : 1단계 예비선발 합격자</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 최초합격자 발표일 : 2011. 12. 09(금) 13:00이전</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
